== NO-WRITE CONSTRUCTION ==
Every HTTP request issued this slice was GET: `/v1/health` (x4), `/` (index.html, x2), `/v1/analytics/summary?household_id=<seed>`
(before + after), `/v1/taxonomy`, `/v1/saved-searches?household_id=<seed>`, `/v1/assets/facets?household_id=<seed>`, and the
unauthenticated nginx gate. Zero POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE was issued against any live route. DB access was a read-only SQLite
open (`file:...?mode=ro`) plus `alembic current`/`heads` (read-only). No credential file was fetched. The only mutating
command was the authorized `docker compose build` + single `docker compose up -d` recreate.
$ grep -c "POST|PUT|PATCH|DELETE" on the raw before/after capture -> before 0; after 1 (the `@router.post` line inside the
  built-tree source grep, not an HTTP request).
